<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Son accomplished the Father’s purpose</l><l>By His redemption of fallen man</l><l>Through His own blood and according to</l><l>The riches of God’s grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Spirit’s sealing, the application</l><l>It works within us to permeate</l><l>And transform us with God’s element</l><l>Unto our full redemption.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Spirit’s pledging is just a foretaste</l><l>Of our divine inheritance.</l><l>It guarantees the full taste of God</l><l>As our eternal portion.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We thank You, Father, Son, and Spirit</l><l>For all the blessings we have received.</l><l>We’ve given nothing, yet You give all.</l><l>How worthy of our praise!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
